<title>USA: Seafield Capital sets stock dividend date.</title>
<headline>Seafield Capital sets stock dividend date.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seafield Capital Corp said Thursday it will distribute one share of a newly formed subsidiary called  SLH Corp on March 3 to its shareholders of record February 24.</p>
<p>SLH will be be made up of all of Seafield's real estate and energy businesses, other miscellaneous assets and certain liabilities, Seacoast said.</p>
<p>Seafield said its board believes the spinoff will allow SLH to focus on its relatively illiquid and developmental assets, while Seafield concentrates on its laboratory testing and health care businesses.</p>
<p>Seafield shares closed down 1/2 Thursday at 39-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
